{"id":"75fad619adeaa882","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-cut-reduction.md","title":"降低切秩的结果关系","display":"df-cut-reduction — 降低切秩的结果关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-cut-reduction","aliases":["18-df-cut-reduction","18-df-036"],"display":"df-cut-reduction — 降低切秩的结果关系","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]","[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-cut-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-cut-reduction</span><span>18-df-036</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-reduction — 降低切秩的结果关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定规则实例集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(k\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T&#39;\\)</span> 为候选证明树。其根、标签与切秩见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{crk}\">\\(\\mathrm{crk}\\)</span> 取上述上游定义；本节引入关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutReduction}_{\\mathcal P,k}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutReduction}_{\\mathcal P,k}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CutReduction}_{\\mathcal P,k}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\ell_{\\mathcal T&#39;}(r_{\\mathcal T&#39;})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\leq k+1\\land\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\\leq k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CutReduction}_{\\mathcal P,k}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\ell_{\\mathcal T&#39;}(r_{\\mathcal T&#39;})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\leq k+1\\land\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\\leq k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义的是降秩后的输入输出关系；没有宣称它是一条局部重写步骤、可计算变换或对任意演算总定义的函数。旧稿未要求两棵树为同一演算的合法证明。实际存在性须有具体切消定理，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fca2fdd37fa20a53\" href=\"?note=fca2fdd37fa20a53\" title=\"18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination\">18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定规则实例集 $\\mathcal P$，$k\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T'$ 为候选证明树。其根、标签与切秩见 [[18-df-proof-tree]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定规则实例集 $\\mathcal P$，$k\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T'$ 为候选证明树。其根、标签与切秩见 [[18-df-proof-tree]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"fca2fdd37fa20a53","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"定义的是降秩后的输入输出关系；没有宣称它是一条局部重写步骤、可计算变换或对任意演算总定义的函数。旧稿未要求两棵树为同一演算的合法证明。实际存在性须有具体切消定理，见 [[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{crk}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutReduction}_{\\mathcal P,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CutReduction}_{\\mathcal P,k}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T')\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T')\\\\\n&\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\ell_{\\mathcal T'}(r_{\\mathcal T'})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\leq k+1\\land\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T')\\leq k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1420,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-cut-reduction]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-reduction]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["68c5bcff4a164cd8","570d01ae273edcd2","fca2fdd37fa20a53"]}